  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Phantom Island**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [7]\n- **Deadstick**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [7]\n- **Lonely Cosmos**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [7]\n- **Eternal Return**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [7]\n- **Panpsych**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [7]\n- **Spacesick**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [7]\n- **Aerodynamic**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [7]\n- **Sea of Doubt**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [7]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-07-28.SchoepsMK41.Burns.Flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 123 min; rated 3.75/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer notes a tracking error where tracks eleven and twelve are mislabeled [4]\n- **kglw2025-07-28-PolyTapes**: source not stated; 17 songs; 122 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Chamber Orchestra of Philadelphia performed the entire show, led by conductor Sarah Hicks [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-07-28.SchoepsMK41.Burns.Flac24**: taped by Joe Burns; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Schoeps MK41's > Actives > Baby-N-Box > Roland r07 > 24/48 [1]. Also: Schoeps MK41 mics recorded to Roland R07, then processed in Audacity and CDWAV [1]\n- **kglw2025-07-28-PolyTapes**: taped by PolyTapes; transferred by PolyTapes; source: Zoom H4Essential [2]",
